WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:01,360
Immortality

2
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:02,660
I'll give you something

3
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:04,140
But the ugly story lies ahead

4
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:05,780
It's really nerve-wracking

5
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:08,140
This skin may not be able to save your life.

6
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:09,420
If you don't go in, you'll dismantle the mine.

7
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:10,940
Someone else blew it up for us that day

8
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:12,260
I'm not the only one who died

9
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:17,380
good guy

10
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:19,160
This thing was given to us

11
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:24,860
I'm not trying to show you power by turning on the pressure on the right side and igniting on the left side.

12
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:27,940
Before you seize the moving machine, cut it down first and then what?

13
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:31,580
What is sprayed out is solidified gas, which cannot be destroyed by pouring oil or water on it.

14
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:32,740
Really sticky with fire

15
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:34,260
Can be burned to the bone
